    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d364">

                <pb facs="0515" n="409" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg409"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Emperor of China to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking, China</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Greeting: We are very much pleased on receiving Your Excellency’s special
                    telegram of congratulation upon the auspicious completion of the new cable
                    joining the Pacific coast of your country to the Far East. It is our sincere
                    hope that by the completion of this new cable the commerce of your country and
                    China will become more prosperous.</p>
                <p>By order of the Empress Dowager we now offer to Your Excellency our sincere
                    congratulations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Emperor of China.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
